  "translation": "Nakĩ ⟨Ahabu⟩ oigire atĩrĩ kwa aratumia a Beni-Hadadi: Mwĩrĩri mũthamaki, mwathi wakwa, ũndũ wothe ũrĩa wathĩnire kwa mũtumia waku wa mbere nĩngawĩka, no ũyũ nɗĩngĩhota kũwĩka. Aratumia nao magĩthiĩ, makĩcookia ⟨ĩhoya rĩu⟩.",
